# {{.ExportedName}}

A go-sicky service project.

## Getting Started

```bash
make build
make run
```

## Configuration

Edit `config.json` to change server addresses and framework options:

- Fiber server listens on `:3000` (fasthttp)
- net/http server listens on `:9980` (bunrouter)
- gRPC server listens on `:44945`
- Manager endpoints (`:8888`): `/metrics`, `/health`, `/ready`, `/live`

Verify a running HTTP stack:

```bash
curl localhost:3000/ping   # fiber
curl localhost:9980/ping   # net/http
```

## MCP Configuration

For MCP-type services over stdio:

```json
{
    "mcpServers": {
        "{{.Name}}": {
            "command": "./bin/svc"
        }
    }
}
```

## Docker

Plain tags resolve to docker.io by default (no registry prefix).
Retag explicitly for a private registry.

```bash
make docker
make push
```

## Project Structure

```
{{.Name}}/
  main.go        # Entry point
  config.go      # Configuration struct
  config.json    # Default configuration
  handler/       # Server handlers (fiber.go, http.go, grpc.go)
  Dockerfile     # Multi-stage image build
  Makefile       # Build targets
```
